      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warfield%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Floyd turned Warfield into a shipping point for his coal mine, the first in future Martin County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
