      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warfield%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Warfield served as Martin County's seat from 1870 to 1873 before the seat moved.",
